# Videos: latest 4 thumbnails via public RSS (no key). Optional API backup:
# VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
# VITE_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID=UCnih7SZHTbg6woJkhKGQADA
#
# Vercel note: local .env is not deployed automatically.
# Add VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY in Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables,
# then redeploy. If the Google API key has HTTP referrer restrictions, allow your Vercel domain.

# Contact form — pick ONE (or set Supabase first; it takes priority over Web3Forms):
#
# EASIEST — Web3Forms (free): https://web3forms.com → create form → copy Access Key → set admin email there.
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# OR — Supabase Edge Function `send-contact-email` (see supabase/functions/)
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...

# Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API (copy URL + anon key).
# Deploy function: supabase functions deploy send-contact-email
# Then set secrets (Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets, or: supabase secrets set KEY=value):
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...                    # https://resend.com
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=sunriseclasses@gmail.com
# RESEND_FROM=Sunrise Classes <onboarding@resend.dev>
# Use a domain you verify at Resend in RESEND_FROM for production.
